# heat-box.speak — an insulated box: Neumann (no-flux) boundaries.
# The stove keeps injecting heat; the walls let none escape, so MEAN
# temperature climbs without plateau — energy is conserved plus source.

-- CONFIG --
GRID IS 33 BY 33
WORLD IS 2.0 WIDE
TIME FROM 0 TO 10 BY 0.1
SEED IS 3

-- DATA --
temperature IS FIELD
alpha IS NUMBER WITH VALUE 0.05
stove IS SPOT AT 1.0, 1.0

-- SETUP --
SOLVE dtemperature/dt = alpha * lap(temperature)
APPLY BOUNDARY wall TO temperature
HOLD temperature AT 5.0 WITHIN 0.2 OF stove

-- SIMULATION --
STEP THE FIELD
REPORT MEAN temperature EVERY 20
